      <div class="step-desc">Freeze both encoder and LLM. Train only the MLP projector on 1M SA-1B images with auto-generated captions. Stabilizes initialization before large-scale training.</div>
      <div class="step-code">data: 1M images · trainable: projector only · resolution: 2×2 tiles</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-box">
