    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-title">Stage 2 — Large-Scale Midtraining</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Train on 66.1M synthetic samples: natural images, charts, documents, egocentric and exocentric videos. All data from open-source models only — no proprietary annotations. Establishes base capability and scaling laws.</div>
      <div class="step-code">data: 66.1M synthetic · resolution: up to 16 tiles / 16 frames</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="step-box">
