<div class="section-no">06 — Results</div>
<h2>Beating GPT-4o on Video — With No Distillation</h2>
<p>PLM-VideoBench is the new benchmark suite introduced alongside the model, covering exactly the capabilities that existing benchmarks neglect: fine-grained activity understanding (FGQA), smart-glasses egocentric QA (SGQA), region captioning (RCap), region temporal localization (RTLoc), and region dense captioning (RDCap).</p>
